				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://straininfo.dsmz.de</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">In microbiology, the communication and comparison of research findings and data is often complicated by the existence of a number of different designation and identifiers for the same strain. StrainInfo is a service developed to provide a resolution of microbial strain identifiers by storing culture collection numbers, their relations, and culture-associated data.
